WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.449 --> 00:00:09.280
Did you know 40%, 40% of Fortune 500 companies
in America are founded by an immigrant or

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:11.430
a child of an immigrant?

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:12.430
40%.

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:14.860
That's 200 of the biggest companies in America.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:16.480
That's a lot of numbers there, right?

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:21.950
Then you hear Inked Magazine say that immigrants
are twice as likely to become entrepreneurs

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:23.660
than somebody that's actually born here.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:24.730
Why is that?

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:26.430
Why does that take place?

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:31.450
Today I want to talk to you about the 10 reasons
why immigrants make great entrepreneurs.

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:35.140
If you have any questions, thoughts, comments,
make sure you post your comments on the bottom.

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:39.860
